{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111363","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111363/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111363/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111363/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111363","id":3491288483,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6sfB1h","number":111363,"title":"Remove edit version tracking from `Object`","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","color":"aaccff","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2304948121,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMzA0OTQ4MTIx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:codestyle","name":"topic:codestyle","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":4,"created_at":"2025-10-07T12:28:58Z","updated_at":"2026-02-07T12:35:48Z","closed_at":"2026-01-02T17:15:35Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111363","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111363","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111363.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111363.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"`_edit_version` in `Object` has only one usage, which is a hash that is used in the resource thumbnail generation.\r\n\r\n`_edit_version` was only increased when directly calling `set_edited`.\r\nThe cases when this happens can be categorized as:\r\n\r\n- when resources are saved or loaded (I suspect this is the main usecase for thumbnails, because the hash changes on save)\r\n- when the folding state of inspector sections changed -> this has no influence on thumbnails anyway\r\n- on `AudioServer` which is not a resource -> not relevant for thumbnail generation\r\n- in some editor plugins this is called on specific resource subtypes. Namely a lot of OpenXR resources and Tileset. Both of them are irrelevant for thumbnails based on my understanding. (the bump when saving resources would be enough to generate new thumbnails, and thumbnails seem to only be generated for persisted changes anyway)\r\n\r\nThere already is a \"versioning\" on `Resource` which is update when resources are saved: `last_modified_time`.\r\n\r\nThis PR changes the hashing used for thumbnails to be based on `last_modified_time` and removes `_edit_version` from object.\r\n\r\nOn it's own this does not make object smaller in memory due to padding, however it opens up a nice 4byte spot for `_lock_index`, which in combination with https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111339 can remove 8byte from object, for `DEBUG` enabled builds.","closed_by":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111363/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":2,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111363/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}